  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-12T22:31:47.322Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We are currently only allowed to set the value via the various UI components `value` and `text`. \nBut applying values this way will trigger the UI event actions, which isn't always ideal.\nSo it would be good if we could get the all the UI methods for `SetValueWithoutNotify` and `SetTextWithoutNotify` to be permitted within the UI event actions. So that we can update the UI without triggering their actions.",
